      <div class="article-meta">
        <span>By <a href="/about" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;">Nazim · Social Ninja's</a></span><span>·</span><span>Published September 2026</span><span>·</span><span>6 min read</span>
      </div>
      <p class="article-intro">There is nothing more frustrating than launching an ad campaign or posting a social bio link, only to discover that customers get an "Invalid Number" error. Here is the definitive troubleshooting guide to diagnose and fix broken WhatsApp links in under 60 seconds.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

