      <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

      <h3>Can I test my WhatsApp link without messaging myself?</h3>
      <p>Yes! Simply paste your generated link into any mobile or desktop browser and hit Enter. You should see the official WhatsApp confirmation screen displaying your pre-filled message.</p>

      <h3>Does WhatsApp click-to-chat work for landline numbers?</h3>
      <p>Only if the landline number has been registered on the WhatsApp Business app via phone call verification. Standard personal WhatsApp accounts cannot be activated on landline numbers.</p>

      <h3>Can I edit the destination phone number of an existing WhatsApp link?</h3>
      <p>If you used a direct <code>wa.me/12345...</code> link, you cannot change the number without re-generating the link. However, if you created a short branded link using LinkWA's custom slug feature, you can route the link to a new phone number anytime without breaking printed QR codes or social bio links!</p>

